<title>USA: Snapple to be offered on United flights.</title>
<headline>Snapple to be offered on United flights.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Snapple Beverages, a unit of Quaker Oats Co, said Monday its products will be served on United Airlines flights in the United States and Canada as of October 31.</p>
<p>United, which is owned by UAL Corp, said Snapple was added in response to customer feedback and a survey of its 22,000 flight attendants.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
